    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Conduct a 360‑degree digital condition audit before loading. Capture photos of the front, rear, sides, and under‑carriage, noting scratches, dents or rust. Upload the images to the transport portal, tagging them with ‘bike transport’ and the origin, e.g., ‘bike transport from Anand’, to create an immutable record.</p>
